    {
      "uid": "zhcn:846fe967243ff7b7c3a9cb0c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "开始搜寻──\n……并未找到线索。\n要怎么做才能把“心意”实体化呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "24cb4d53eb992dae25f5111cdd30f0dd45cec8470bff4aeb16a1e066b902b1dc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
