    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28ac49d8f97e7afcf92c42ca",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我向她解释，烦恼要送对方哪种巧克力，\n像这样伤脑筋的过程中所花费的时间，\n应该也算是给对方的一种“心意”才对。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cae6a3179a84719a66aa17594f250a78871c8a2f1d5662bf102680e2fa9f4fa6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
